  ],
  "lines_iast": [
   "na ca nāpekṣate dravyaṃ; dravyāpekṣayā ca tribhāgasauhityamardhasauhityaṃ vā gurūṇāmupadiśyate, laghūnāmapi ca nātisauhityamagneryuktyartham"
  ],
